      "page": 1,
      "x": 0.7,
      "y": 5.73,
      "w": 2.2,
      "z": 3,
      "md": "Rates **unchanged since 2009**, and none of the revenue reaches Hawaiian Home Lands.\n\nThe tax jumps at set prices: about **$2,000** just under $1M, **$3,000** at $1M.\n\n**~30,000** beneficiaries are waiting for homestead lots.",
