      "x": 3.1500000000000004,
      "y": 4.6,
      "w": 2.2,
      "z": 3,
      "md": "less for working families in 2028 if the 2023 expansions expire. Renewing costs about $307M over 2028–2031.",
      "style": {
        "font": "Poppins",
        "size": 11.5,
        "color": "#4A5568",
        "leading": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bul2",
      "page": 1,
      "x": 3.1500000000000004,
      "y": 5.73,
      "w": 2.2,
      "z": 3,
      "md": "Act 163 doubled the **earned income** and **food/excise** credits; both end after 2027.\n\nAbout **180,000 households** would receive less. Single parents lose **$817** on average.\n\n**~2,100** more people, about 500 keiki, fall into poverty.",
      "style": {
        "font": "Poppins",
        "size": 12,
        "color": "#4A5568",
        "leading": 1.42
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "suph2",
